Airport Golf Club
CHEYENNE, WYOMING
July 20, 2014
Mr.Rick Parish
Director, Parks and Recreation
City of Cheyenne, Room302
2101 O'Neil Avenue
Cheyenne, Wyoming 82001
RE:2014Annual Report to the City of Cheyenne-Lease Agreement No.2833
Dear Mr. Parish:
Respectfully submitted herein is the annual report to the City of Cheyenne regarding
capitol improvements made to the golf course and the building located at4801 Central
Avenue as required by Lease Agreement No.2833 between the City of Cheyenne and the
Airport Golf Club, Inc.
A listing of ongoing repair/maintenance items is also provided for your general
information.The last twoitems in this report reflect amounts that the Club contributes
towards its scholarship program aswell as sponsorships/donations tovarious local
organizations. The data in this report covers the period from July 2013 through June
2014.
